to; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9d178fc3-765b-44af-a62d-c2a0dcae9561.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"69b01fc7-e2c8-4f07-8a1e-d6bd9ea5817c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026orjb7K4q9G1784085548.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"69b01fc7-e2c8-4f07-8a1e-d6bd9ea5817c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T04:19:27.361036+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":355,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}